WEBVTT

00:06:29.009 --> 00:06:30.719
being near Kanye West.

00:06:30.719 --> 00:06:31.762
(Laughter)

00:06:31.804 --> 00:06:34.223
OK, OK, that wasn't really
in the criteria,

00:06:34.223 --> 00:06:35.641
but it just so happens

00:06:35.683 --> 00:06:39.812
our piece of land in Wyoming
is not far from Kanye's own Cody ranch.

00:06:42.731 --> 00:06:43.941
The next steps at CityDAO

00:06:43.983 --> 00:06:46.485
are things like voting
on what gets built on the land

00:06:46.527 --> 00:06:48.112
and who gets to use it when.

00:06:49.071 --> 00:06:52.199
Some other proposals floating around

00:06:52.241 --> 00:06:56.370
are things like buying a piece of land
in the Amazon for conservation

00:06:56.370 --> 00:07:00.291
or building out a network
of DAO-owned spaces